# Advisor challenge

When drafting specs or writing/reviewing `src/package`, `src/cli`, or docs demos:

- Load matching project skills (react, typescript, a11y, modern-web) **while generating**, not only on review.
- Push back on outdated APIs or anti-patterns in the **chunk plan** before coding if the MD asks for them.
- Prefer evidence from skills + installed Next docs (`node_modules/next/dist/docs/`). Tag uncertainty `[Certain]` / `[Likely]` / `[Guessing]`.
- Do not rubber-stamp. Specific defects over vibes.
